        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86103, Tuscany Bronze Twisted Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twist Tuscany Bronze Cabinet Pull has an old world look that is great for rustic-styled homes. This Tuscany Bronze Twist Pull is available in 6 sizes ranging from 3 inches all the way up to 10 inches in length. The Tuscany Bronze Twisted Cabinet Handle is available in medium bronze and flat black bronze finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Tuscany Bronze Twist Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86103-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Tuscany Bronze Twist Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86103:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86104:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86105:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86238:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86239:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86240:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
